      "value": "Already kind of possible by animating the root. You can use the additive layer if you still want some sort of locomotion movement. \nYou can give a try to my prefab. Not perfect but better then nothing\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15TezWr-srzR0kas_FPHrQjC7nPg5d7mb",
